# Next slice

When the user says **implement next slice**, **next slice**, or **continue the queue**:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/implement-next-slice/SKILL.md`.
2. Read `docs/slices.md`.
3. Do the first unchecked **AFK** slice. Stop if the first open item is **HITL**.

Do not treat GitHub issues, `~/.cursor/plans`, or chat transcripts as the queue. Those are background. `docs/slices.md` is the queue.
